  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Livelihood Opportunities and Accessibility for underserved urban communities in Meru, Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to a) create employment opportunities and skills in labor-based road maintenance, and b) improve the basic access to the target population of the selected underserved urban communities of Meru town.</narrative>
  </description>
